flowchart TD
  CODE[gitops-python-app] --> CI[GitHub Actions: test / build / scan]
  CI --> HUB[(Docker Hub: immutable SHA tag)]
  CI -->|update dev tag| GIT[(gitops-python-deployment)]
  GIT --> ARGO[Argo CD ApplicationSet]
  ARGO -->|auto sync| DEV[Flask Dev + Vault Agent]
  ARGO -->|manual prod sync| PROD[Flask Prod x2 + Vault Agent]
  HUB --> DEV
  HUB --> PROD
  subgraph K3S[Single-node Rancher Desktop K3s]
    DEV
    PROD
    subgraph VAULT[Vault HA with integrated Raft]
      V0[vault-0]
      V1[vault-1]
      V2[vault-2]
    end
    PROM[Prometheus + ServiceMonitor]
    GRAF[Grafana]
    ADAPTER[Prometheus Adapter: custom metrics API]
    HPA[Dev HPA: 100 requests/minute per pod]
  end
  DEV -->|Kubernetes JWT / KV v2 dev policy| VAULT
  PROD -->|Kubernetes JWT / KV v2 prod policy| VAULT
  DEV --> PROM
  PROD --> PROM
  PROM --> GRAF
  PROM --> ADAPTER
  ADAPTER --> HPA
  HPA --> DEV
